    "suptitle": "Exact Shapley share by block, within activity deciles",
    "fig_texts": [
      "113,262 features, full dictionary; collinearity collapsed at |rho| >= 0.9 (complete linkage)  |  REAL TARGET - dense context to SAE feature map, mlp__mean arm (#1482 single-turn corpus, 121,111 scored; covariates same corpus)",
      "The firing-frequency block IS the stratifying variable: within an activity decile its\nvariance is restricted BY CONSTRUCTION and its share is mechanically suppressed.\nDo NOT read 'activity contributes nothing within deciles' as a finding.",
      "x = axis suppressed (a class below the 30-feature floor). Flagged axes carry globally rare classes: side_class carries '2' (261 pooled); speaker_property carries 'unclear' (22 pooled).\nDeciles are equal-COUNT, not equal-width in log-activity \u2014 d1 (42.0x) and d10 (8.6x) are the least tightly conditioned columns. Uncertainty is split-half, not bootstrap."
